; lake_high_wall.room - A Parede Alta (design 04 section 3.5): the floor passage (rows 29-32) needs nothing; the alcove
; on the wall (top row 8) is 10 rows above the bank, beyond a double jump from flat ice. Inverno Logico 2: Redoma at the
; lip (col 15) raises the lake into `u`, Congelar fixes it. Combinado 2: Vendaval west, Congelar fixes the crest.

